OL,3,GNEWSAHousing project 'stuck in the
OL,4,Amud', councillor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local authority's proposed
OL,7,Fredevelopment project is "stuck in the
OL,8,Fmud", according to a councillor.
OL,10,FIn 2024, Waverley Borough Council
OL,11,Fagreed a budget of #21m to turn a free
OL,12,Fcar park and youth club at the
OL,13,FFairground site in Haslemere into a
OL,14,Fsupermarket with housing.
OL,16,FBut no retailers have decided to move
OL,17,Fforward with the council despite three
OL,18,Fmaking early enquiries into the site,
OL,19,Faccording to the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
